Implementa la funzione `sliding_window_analyze` con questa firma e comportamento:

```python
def sliding_window_analyze(
    file_path: Path,
    file_dir: Path,           # projects/<slug>/01_INGEST/<filename>/
    llm_fn: callable,         # llm_complete da core/ai_tasks
    stop_event: threading.Event,
    log_fn: callable,
